    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-general-first-a-mathematics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅰ問　対数関数と整数値（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "アイ −2／ウ 3／エ 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）",
                "value": "オ 1／カ 3／キ 5／ク 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）",
                "value": "ケ 2／コ 8／サシ −3／ス 4"
              },
              {
                "label": "（4）",
                "value": "セ 3／ソ 7／タ 7"
              },
              {
                "label": "（5）",
                "value": "チ 8／ツテ 18／トナ 18"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　二倍角公式で真数を二次式にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "対数の真数を直接扱う前に、\\(t=\\cos x\\) と置ける形へ変えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1-\\cos 2x-3\\cos x=-2\\cos^2x-3\\cos x+2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=\\log_5(-2t^2-3t+2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　真数条件とcosの値域を重ねる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-2t^2-3t+2>0\\iff(2t-1)(t+2)<0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "二次不等式から \\(-2<t<1/2\\)。さらに \\(-1\\le t\\le1\\) と重ねると \\(-1\\le t<1/2\\) です。単位円に戻して \\(\\pi/3<x<5\\pi/3\\) を得ます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-domain-circle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　真数の最大値を平方完成で求める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-2t^2-3t+2=-2\\left(t+\\frac34\\right)^2+\\frac{25}{8}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "底5は1より大きいので、真数が最大のとき \\(f\\) も最大です。よって最大値は \\(\\log_5(25/8)=2-\\log_5 8\\)、そのとき \\(\\cos x=-3/4\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-parabola",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-general-first-a-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　整数水平線との交点を数える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(5^{f(x)}=-2t^2-3t+2\\le25/8\\) なので、最大の整数は3です。整数値1、2、3ごとに二次方程式の解を調べ、各 \\(t\\) に対応する角 \\(x\\) を数えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a2-unit-circle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(t=-1\\) には \\(x=\\pi\\) が1個、\\(-1<t<1/2\\) の各 \\(t\\) には和が \\(2\\pi\\) となる2個の角が対応します。したがって総数は7、総和は \\(7\\pi\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5)　最大値を常用対数で挟む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\log_{10}\\left(20^{\\log_5(25/8)}\\right)=\\left(2-\\frac{3\\log_{10}2}{1-\\log_{10}2}\\right)(1+\\log_{10}2)\\fallingdotseq0.9213",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\log_{10}8=0.9030<0.9213<\\log_{10}9\\) なので、最大の整数は8です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-general-first-a-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(g(t)=3\\) では \\(20^{\\log_5 3}\\) は7と8の間です。したがって8に対応する \\(t\\) は頂点近くの2個で、角 \\(x\\) は4個です。1から7には各2個ずつ対応するので、総数は \\(4+2\\times7=18\\)、総和は \\(4\\pi+2\\pi\\times7=18\\pi\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅱ問　硬貨列と二項確率（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "ア 2／イ 9／ウエ 19／オカ 27"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）（i）",
                "value": "キ 1／ク 2／ケ 2／コ 3／サ 3／シ 5"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）（ii）",
                "value": "スセ 13／ソタ 32／チ 9／ツテ 64"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）",
                "value": "ト 3／ナ 4／ニ 7／ヌ 9"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　ちょうど2回と少なくとも1回",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_3C_2\\left(\\frac13\\right)^2\\frac23=\\frac29",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1-\\left(\\frac23\\right)^3=\\frac{19}{27}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)(i)　末尾が表か裏かで分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "表が2回続かない列を末尾別に列挙すると、\\(a_2=1,b_2=2\\)、\\(a_3=2,b_3=3\\)、\\(a_4=3,b_4=5\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-general-first-a-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)(ii)　フィボナッチ型の漸化式を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_{n+1}=b_n,\\qquad b_{n+1}=a_n+b_n=b_{n-1}+b_n",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(a_5=5,b_5=8\\) なので \\(P(X_5)=13/32\\)。同じ漸化式から \\(a_{10}=55,b_{10}=89\\) となり、\\(P(X_{10})=(55+89)/2^{10}=9/64\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　条件を二つの不等式に分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最初の条件では、表3回の全10通りと、3連続を含む表3回・表4回の場合を比較します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_5C_3p^3(1-p)^2>3p^3(1-p)^2+2p^4(1-p)\\iff p<\\frac79",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次に15回中の表の回数を \\(k\\) とした確率 \\(P(k)\\) の隣接項比を調べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{P(k+1)}{P(k)}=\\frac{p(15-k)}{(k+1)(1-p)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-general-first-a-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "12回がただ一つの最大項となる条件は \\(11<16p-1<12\\)、すなわち \\(3/4<p<13/16\\) です。先の \\(p<7/9\\) と重ねて \\(3/4<p<7/9\\) を得ます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅲ問　球と平面の交円（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "ア 2／イ 2／ウ 8／エ 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）",
                "value": "オ 4／カ 3／キ 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）（i）",
                "value": "ク 2／ケ 6／コ 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）（ii）",
                "value": "サ 4／シ 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）（iii）",
                "value": "ス 0／セ 8／ソ 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）（iv）",
                "value": "タチ −2／ツ 8／テ 8／ト 4／ナ 2／ニヌ 33／ネ 9"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　中点と正三角形を確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "BCの中点は \\(M(0,2,2)\\) なので \\(OM=2\\sqrt2\\)。またABCは一辺 \\(4\\sqrt2\\) の正三角形です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[ABC]=\\frac12(4\\sqrt2)^2\\sin\\frac\\pi3=8\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a5-coordinate-space",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　対称性から垂足を重心と見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Oから平面ABCへの垂足HはA、B、Cから等距離です。正三角形では外心と重心が一致するため \\(H(4/3,4/3,4/3)\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a5-plane-circle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "OH=\\sqrt{3\\left(\\frac43\\right)^2}=\\frac{4\\sqrt3}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-general-first-a-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(i)　球の半径と中心から平面までの距離を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "XH=\\sqrt{OX^2-OH^2}=\\sqrt{8-\\frac{16}{3}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt6}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a6-right-triangle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(ii)　和と積をpに集約する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "球面条件と交円の中心Hからの距離条件を比べると \\(p+q+r=4\\) です。よって \\(q+r=4-p\\)。さらに \\(q^2+r^2=8-p^2\\) と和の二乗を使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "qr=\\frac{(q+r)^2-(q^2+r^2)}2=(p-2)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(iii)　qとrの実数条件を判別式で表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(p-4)^2-4(p-2)^2=-3p^2+8p\\ge0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって \\(0\\le p\\le8/3\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(iv)　面積を一変数化する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac12\\sqrt{(p^2+q^2)(p^2+r^2)-p^4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-general-first-a-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\sqrt{-2p^3+8p^2-8p+4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "根号内を \\(F(p)\\) と置き、先に \\(F\\) を区間 \\(0\\le p\\le8/3\\) で最小化します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "F'(p)=-6p^2+16p-8=-2(3p-2)(p-2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "p",
              "0",
              "…",
              "2/3",
              "…",
              "2",
              "…",
              "8/3"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "F'(p)",
                "−",
                "",
                "0",
                "+",
                "0",
                "−",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "F(p)",
                "4",
                "↘",
                "44/27",
                "↗",
                "4",
                "↘",
                "44/27"
              ]
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "増減から \\(F\\) の最小値は \\(44/27\\)。よって面積の最小値は \\(\\sqrt{44/27}=2\\sqrt{33}/9\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "確認",
            "text": "根号は単調増加なので、面積Sの最小化は根号内Fの最小化に置き換えられます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
